{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le09ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le09ob07re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le09ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Hi Kristi! How are things coming along?<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Great! As soon as I finish this chapter, I'll forge ahead with the next one. I'd like to keep working on this chapter until it's perfect.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>:  I understand that you have done a lot of editing in previous jobs. You must be pretty good at it.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I suppose that I have worked on several different documents in the past. Nothing really significant yet.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob07re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Well, you'll get lots of experience here! And you know that you can work on the editing anywhere you want, right? We don't really have assigned work spaces here. Just find a spot where you are comfortable and productive!<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I reckon I've been most productive in quiet places, but I do like to have people around. I don't work well in isolation. I guess I've always worked best with the energy of being around people.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Okay. Well, that editing needs to be done by tomorrow, so you have to finish it as soon as possible. It can't be late. If you are late, it holds up the whole production schedule.", "time": "21000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob07re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Okay, I will make this a priority and really focus on it. I imagine that you have chased lots of editorial assistants for their work. I don't want to waste anyone's time.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: So tomorrow will you be ready to work on some layout? We need to get going on that.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Yes. I'll finish up the editing shortly, and then I can begin the layout whenever you want.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: That's great Kristi. I'm glad you're working with us. I think you've been a great addition to the team already.", "time": "56500", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about solving problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can report facts about events or actions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about my work responsibilities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What are the conditions in which you feel you are most productive?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you enjoy working when there are other people around or do you prefer to work alone? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " A check-in with the editor ...", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nKristi <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">brings her editor up to speed</span>. \n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"conte